				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたいの　ランプラーは
ポケモン勝負じゃ　弱いけどさ▽
パンを　上手に　焼くんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T11:32:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
